@teste_HostAddress = http://localhost:5004

### Health check
GET {{teste_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Health check versionado (v1)
GET {{teste_HostAddress}}/api/v1/health
Accept: application/json

### Listar tarefas (v1)
GET {{teste_HostAddress}}/api/v1/todos
Accept: application/json

### Listar tarefas (v2)
GET {{teste_HostAddress}}/api/v2/todos
Accept: application/json

### Criar tarefa (v1)
POST {{teste_HostAddress}}/api/v1/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Estudar Clean Architecture",
  "description": "Implementar camadas Domain, Application e Infrastructure"
}

### Obter por id (v1 — substitua o GUID)
GET {{teste_HostAddress}}/api/v1/todos/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Atualizar tarefa (v1)
PUT {{teste_HostAddress}}/api/v1/todos/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Estudar Clean Architecture (atualizado)",
  "description": null
}

### Concluir tarefa (v1)
PATCH {{teste_HostAddress}}/api/v1/todos/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/complete

### Excluir tarefa (v1)
DELETE {{teste_HostAddress}}/api/v1/todos/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
